<title>CANADA: Canada C$3.0 billion 7-day yields avg 2.975 pct.</title>
<headline>Canada C$3.0 billion 7-day yields avg 2.975 pct.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Canada said its C$3.0 billion auction of seven-day T-bills due April 3, 1997 produced the following results:</p>
<p>				 YIELD</p>
<p>			  AVG   2.975  PCT AT</p>
<p>			  LO    2.950  HI YLD</p>
<p>			  HI    3.020  10.000</p>
<p>The Bank of Canada said it bought none of the issue.</p>
<p>The bills will be dated and issued on March 27.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
</text>
